<h1 id="top">Source Data Cleanup</h1>
<p>Examples of variant targets in the source Wiktionary data that were normalized or cleaned up to resolve matches. Each category shows the original form, the normalized form, and the headword it now resolves to.</p>

<h2 id="cleanup-overview">Overview</h2>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Category</th>
    <th>Targets Fixed</th>
  </tr>
  {% for cat in categories %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ cat.name }}</td>
    <td>{{ "{:,}".format(cat.count) }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

{% for cat in categories %}
<h2 id="{{ cat.anchor }}">{{ cat.name }}</h2>
<p>{{ cat.description }}</p>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Language</th>
    <th>Original</th>
    <th>Normalized</th>
    <th>Headword</th>
  </tr>
  {% for ex in cat.examples %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ ex.locale }}</td>
    <td>{{ ex.original }}</td>
    <td>{{ ex.normalized }}</td>
    <td>{{ ex.headword }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% endfor %}
